  "dcterms:description": "ValueSet IMMZD2DTDengue3DosesWithPreVaccinationScreening for IMMZ.D2.DT.Dengue.3 doses with pre-vaccination screening. Business rule: Determine if the client is due for a dengue vaccination according to the national immunization schedule Trigger: IMMZ.D2 Determine required vaccination(s) if any Table: CYD-TDV (Dengvaxia), 3-dose schedule with pre-vaccination screening, the recommended strategy where feasible (pre-vaccination screening whereby only those tested seropositive would be vaccinated)",
